{"id":"vod_bf_43765","vodId":"43765","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"缘之空","name_cn":"缘之空","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/b1dbbe98957f91655d47600a55f6709d.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一处温馨但偏僻的田园小镇奥木染，双亲过世的少年春日野悠（桥本隆 配音）带着体弱多病的妹妹春日野穹（田口宏子 配音）千里迢迢的来到了这里，准备寄宿在祖父留下的房子中。虽然照顾妹妹的起居很辛苦，但悠还是拥有了一段难得愉快的时光。在这里，悠遇见了幼年的玩伴天女目瑛（阪田佳代 配音），成熟温柔的姐姐依媛奈绪（猪口有佳 配音），认真可爱的大小姐渚一叶（小野凉子 配音）等热情亲切的朋友们，还有同班损友中里亮平（中国卓郎 配音）的插科打诨让他笑口常开。同时，一些模糊的回忆逐渐的浮上了心头，是和谁有过怎样的约定呢？面对着面前似曾相识的风景，悠的记忆开始苏醒。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 21:06:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/yuanzhikong/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:13.022Z"}